OL,3,GNEWSANHS Highland's handling of child
OL,4,Ahealth visit concerns criticised
OL,5,
OL,6,FNHS Highland has been criticised for
OL,7,Fits handling of concerns raised by a
OL,8,Fwhistleblower about the impact of
OL,9,Fstaffing shortages on vulnerable
OL,10,Fchildren.
OL,12,FThe concerns about lengthy gaps between
OL,13,Fhealth visits to families were brought
OL,14,Fto the health board in August 2025.
OL,16,FIn a new report, the Independent
OL,17,FNational Whistleblowing Officer (INWO)
OL,18,Fhas upheld a complaint that NHS
OL,19,FHighland did not fully address the
OL,20,Fconcerns.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,429,420,260,160,0,100
